OL,3,GNEWSA'Pressure' to get Big Ben right as
OL,4,Aclocks go back
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company responsible for accurately
OL,7,Fsetting one of the world's most famous
OL,8,Fclocks has said there is always
OL,9,Fpressure to get it right.
OL,11,FClocks will have to be turned back an
OL,12,Fhour when the UK changes from British
OL,13,FSummer Time (BST) to Greenwich Meantime
OL,14,F(GMT) in the early hours of Sunday.
OL,16,FThe Cumbria Clock Company will once
OL,17,Fagain travel to London to ensure Big
OL,18,FBen keeps the right time and will also
OL,19,Fcarry out essential maintenance work.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
